<title>USA: Sinclair Broadcast Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Sinclair Broadcast Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				Sep 30,   Sep 30,   Sep 30,   Sep 30,</p>
<p>				  1995	1996	1995	1996</p>
<p> Total revenues	    50,177   110,279   147,051   237,189</p>
<p> Net loss		   (4,858)   (3,328)   (4,351)   (1,817)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p>common share, before</p>
<p>  extraordinary item	 0.01    (0.10)	0.02    (0.05)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share,</p>
<p>after extraordinary item</p>
<p>				 (0.14)    (0.10)    (0.14)    (0.05)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding     34,750    34,750    31,325    34,750</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes a $5.13 million charge related to early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
